{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 14, "ref": "genesis 24:14", "book": "genesis", "lang": "pcm", "chapter": 24, "translation": "Make e be ⟨so⟩, sey di girl wey I go talk, 'Tilt ⟨na⟩ ya jar make I drink,' and she go talk, 'Drink, and I go also give ya camels drink' — na ⟨am⟩ you don ⟨את⟩ decide for ya servant, for Yitschak; and by ⟨am⟩ I go know sey you don do chesed wit my master.", "tokens": [{"surface": "והיה", "gloss": "Make e be"}, {"surface": "הנער", "gloss": "di girl"}, {"surface": "אשר", "gloss": "wey"}, {"surface": "אמר", "gloss": "I go talk"}, {"surface": "אליה", "gloss": "to her"}, {"surface": "הטי", "gloss": "Tilt"}, {"surface": "נא", "gloss": "⟨na⟩"}, {"surface": "כדך", "gloss": "ya jar"}, {"surface": "ואשתה", "gloss": "make I drink"}, {"surface": "ואמרה", "gloss": "and she go talk"}, {"surface": "שתה", "gloss": "Drink"}, {"surface": "וגם", "gloss": "and also"}, {"surface": "גמליך", "gloss": "ya camels"}, {"surface": "אשקה", "gloss": "I go give drink"}, {"surface": "אתה", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "you don decide"}, {"surface": "הכחת", "gloss": "decide"}, {"surface": "לעבדך", "gloss": "for ya servant"}, {"surface": "ליצחק", "gloss": "for Yitschak"}, {"surface": "ובה", "gloss": "and by ⟨am⟩"}, {"surface": "אדע", "gloss": "I go know"}, {"surface": "כי", "gloss": "sey"}, {"surface": "עשית", "gloss": "you don do"}, {"surface": "חסד", "gloss": "chesed"}, {"surface": "עם", "gloss": "wit"}, {"surface": "אדני", "gloss": "my master"}], "timestamp": "2026-08-11T14:19:07.870645399Z", "model": "glm-5.2"}